  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund - - FSD Fashion Designing &amp; Hospitality Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSD is proposing to train and certify beneficiaries in courses covering both Fashion Designing and Tourism &amp; Hospitality Management skills. In addition, trainees will be provided skills in customer service. The expected output of the training program is that trainees will be provided internship opportunities.</narrative>
